# Copied from AudioCaps v1.0.0 (commit 049d053) scripts/scan-history.allow; AudioCaps' commit-specific entries removed.
# Values scripts/scan-history.sh accepts, one regex per line. Each is synthetic, not a real address.
# RFC 5737 documentation IPv4 ranges and RFC 7042 documentation MAC range (current unit tests).
^192\.0\.2\.[0-9]+$
^198\.51\.100\.[0-9]+$
^203\.0\.113\.[0-9]+$
^00[:_-]00[:_-]5[eE][:_-]00[:_-]53[:_-][0-9a-fA-F]{2}$
# The null MAC, used as "no address" by the verbatim PII scanner and its standard; not a device.
^00:00:00:00:00:00$
